    <dc:title>A Spark in the Rust</dc:title>
    <dc:creator>The Storm-Born Chronicles</dc:creator>
    <dc:language>en-US</dc:language>
    <dc:publisher>Eden Dome Alpha Archive Division</dc:publisher>
    <dc:date>2072-01-01</dc:date>
    <dc:description>Outside the sealed Green Domes, Sector 09&apos;s toxic Gray Ring is a powder keg. When Tsunari hacks the courier terminal and steals the Lazarus Key, Commander Vram Tyage is sent to eliminate her. But in the ruins of a collapsed solar farm, her touch accidentally grounds his neuro-lattice fever, sparking an outlaw alliance that will burn the sky.</dc:description>
